[size=5][b]✩ For developers[/b][/size]

Dynamic Camera exposes a small Lua interface, [font=Courier New]I.DynamicCamera[/font]: hand it a take-over of the camera while your mod drives it, force the tilt effects on, add extra yaw/pitch/roll that stacks with other mods, and limit how far down the viewmodel tilts. All of it is documented in the [url=https://github.com/MaxYari/DynamicCameraOpenmw#taking-the-camera-over]git repository[/url]. If you are already reading this on git - just read below.

